# CSI TechFest Registration Page

A simple frontend Event Registration Page built using HTML and CSS.

## Technologies Used
- HTML5
- CSS3

## Features
- Event details
- Registration form
- Clean and modern UI

## Live Demo
View the project here:
https://shreyash-128.github.io/Event-management-/

## How to Run Locally
1. Clone or download the repository.
2. Open `index.html` in your browser.

> **Note:** Best viewed on a desktop/laptop browser.
